# WS3-07. Sources: spec/01-lexical.md §2-§3 (these spellings are not Clorraine
# keywords, so they are legal identifiers) and spec/17-codegen.md §7 ("Local: source
# name if it is a valid, unique C identifier; otherwise a stable suffix"): the
# emitted C must stay valid. Sum 1..15 = 120, plus 1.
profiles: host hosted-amiga hosted-amiga-13
expect: output
contrast: let int: i32 = 1; ==> let int: i32 = 2;
contrast-expect: output
--- output
121
--- contrast-output
122
